Mapping: Discovery

Purpose:
  Defines how discovered elements map to .sdd model and
  documentation.

SourceToSddMapping:
  Source:
    ./<layer>/<domain>/<module>/<artifact>
  ↓
  .sdd:
    .sdd/project/tasks/<TASK-ID>.sdd
  ↓
  Domain:
    <domain-name>
  ↓
  Component:
    <ComponentName>
  ↓
  Skill:
    <skill-name>
  ↓
  Test:
    <test-path>
  ↓
  Doc:
    docs/<layer>/<domain>.md

DiscoveryToTaskMapping:
  SECURITY_GAP:
    Missing rate limit
  ↓
  SEC-101

  DOC_GAP:
    Missing deployment documentation
  ↓
  DOC-201

  ARCH-CYCLE:
    payments ↔ orders
  ↓
  ARCH-301

DriftMapping:
  STACK_DRIFT:
    .sdd says Redis, source has Redis + Memcached
  ARCHITECTURE_DRIFT:
    .sdd says Modular Monolith, source shows microservices/
  TASK_DRIFT:
    Task marked DONE but source shows incomplete
  DOC_DRIFT:
    Doc says PostgreSQL sessions, source uses Redis
  SECURITY_DRIFT:
    .sdd has rate limiting, source does not
  TEST_DRIFT:
    .sdd claims E2E tests, none found
  INFRA_DRIFT:
    .sdd says AWS, source uses VPS
  DECISION_DRIFT:
    DEC-017 says Redis, source uses Memcached

DocumentationMapping:
  Source:
    ./<layer>/<domain>/<module>/<artifact>
  ↓
  Doc:
    docs/<layer>/<domain>.md

  Source:
    ./<layer>/migrations/
  ↓
  Doc:
    docs/<layer>/database.md

  Source:
    .github/workflows/
  ↓
  Doc:
    docs/<layer>/ci-cd.md

MappingRules:
  [MP1]  Every source file SHOULD map to a task or component.
  [MP2]  Every domain SHOULD have documentation.
  [MP3]  Every security control SHOULD be documented.
  [MP4]  Drift MUST be reported, not silently ignored.

State: +
  